  "id": "RUSTSEC-2026-0404",
  "modified": "2026-10-26T14:00:05.092817237Z",
  "published": "2026-10-16T12:00:00Z",
  "summary": "Double free in `DCtx::try_clone`",
  "details": "`DCtx::try_clone` (`experimental` feature, deprecated) is a plain copy of the\nC context. A context owning a dictionary (from `load_dictionary`,\n`ref_prefix` or `init_using_dict`) or a dictionary table (`ref_ddict` with\n`RefMultipleDDicts`) ended up with both copies freeing it. A context cloned\nmid-frame resumed on uninitialized stream state. The clone also silently lost\nthe `WindowLogMax` limit.\n\nThe flaw was corrected by refusing to clone such contexts, and by carrying\nover the parameters the copy leaves out.",
  "affected": [
